Place: Module, Exported, DefaultNamed, DefaultAnonymous, Function, Block, Method
ClassDecorator: None, One, Two
Member: None, Method, Field, Static, Accessor
Parameter: None, Constructor, Method
SelfName: No, Yes
Abstract: No, Yes

IF [Place] = "DefaultAnonymous" THEN [SelfName] = "No";
IF [Parameter] = "Method" THEN [Member] = "Method";
